        rules: {
          objective: 'Avoid winning tricks that contain figures (Aces, Kings, Overs, Unders). Winning tricks with only numeral cards (X, IX, VIII, VII) is safe. The player with the fewest figures captured wins.',
          gameplay: 'No trumps. Must follow suit if possible. Highest card of led suit wins the trick. The winner of a trick leads to the next.',
          keyRules: [
            'Must follow suit if able',
            'No trumps',
            'Figures (A, K, Over, Under) are bad to capture',
            'Ace counts as 3 figures if it wins',
