          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Try to win tricks with numeral cards only. Avoid playing high cards that might win tricks containing figures. Get rid of Aces early if you think they will win.',
          intermediate: 'Track which figures have been played. Force opponents to win tricks with figures by playing cards they must overtake. Void yourself in suits where you hold high cards.',
          advanced: 'Card counting is essential with 32 cards. Calculate when to win a trick to reach safety. Understand the timing of when to transition from avoiding tricks to seeking them.',
